    "Seamlessly Integrate Documents Integration with the Project Module": "دمج تكامل المستندات بسلاسة مع وحدة المشروع",
    "Experience the seamless integration of Dash SaaS's Documents Integration with the Project Module, revolutionizing project document management. Effortlessly link project-related documents, streamline collaboration, and enhance transparency within your project teams. With centralized document organization and project-centric features, empower your teams to achieve greater productivity and efficiency in project execution.": "استمتع بتجربة التكامل السلس لتكامل مستندات Dash SaaS مع وحدة المشروع، مما يحدث ثورة في إدارة مستندات المشروع. ",
    "Enhanced Collaboration with Attachments:": "تعزيز التعاون مع المرفقات:",
